      "writtenOn": "2023-11-28T14:11:24Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Here, we are locking the template, but if some template is already locked, we won\u0027t match against it. Is it a problem? The `dec_state-\u003eis_locked` and `FP_CONTEXT_STATUS_MATCH_PROCESSED_SET` are protecting against matching the same template more than once. Is it possible to remove `FP_CONTEXT_STATUS_MATCH_PROCESSED_SET`?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 169,
        "startChar": 2,
        "endLine": 169,
        "endChar": 30
      },
      "revId": "39b88ed14ae7139542ef3e69204a7df9e657a6e5",
