      "writtenOn": "2023-11-28T15:51:13Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Added comments.\n\nThe reason of \"FP_CONTEXT_STATUS_MATCH_PROCESSED_SET\" is preventing the attacker unlock template multiple times in a single nonce context.\n\n(It\u0027s \"fine\" to remove the \"dec_state-\u003eis_locked \u003d true;\" here, but that may make the code more confusing.)",
      "parentUuid": "59de2814_77856769",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 169,
        "startChar": 2,
        "endLine": 169,
        "endChar": 30
      },
      "revId": "39b88ed14ae7139542ef3e69204a7df9e657a6e5",
